[engl]
{100}{}{Seth}
{200}{}{You see Seth, leader of the guards of Shady Sands.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Begin}
{1020}{}{Weapon check}
{1030}{}{Radscorpions killed}
{1040}{}{Quest ongoing}
{1050}{}{End of the dialogue}
{2000}{}{Good day. I am called Seth. How can I help you?}
{2010}{}{I'd like some information.}
{2020}{}{Bloop?}
{3000}{}{Information? What do you want to know about?}
{3010}{}{I want to know about the Radscorpions.}
{3020}{}{I want to know about the raiders.}
{3030}{}{I want to know about this place.}
{3040}{}{Take me to the Radscorpion caves.}
{3050}{}{I don't need to know anything else.}
{4000}{}{Not very bright, eh? Well, watch out for the Radscorpions, and stay out of trouble.}
{4010}{}{Scorpin!}
{4020}{}{Cave!}
{5000}{}{Those damn Radscorpions have been after our Brahmin since we moved here. Not a week goes by that someone doesn't get poisoned trying to keep them out of the pens. Last week they took my brother Jarvis. Razlo, our doctor, is looking for an antidote as quickly as he can. Hey, if you have the means to help us, why don't you talk to our leader, Aradesh.}
{5010}{}{I will.}
{5020}{}{[End.]}
{6000}{}{There are several groups of raiders. I organize guards like Ian to help fight them off. There is one band to the southeast of here. Watch out for them.}
{6010}{}{[End.]}
{7000}{}{Shady Sands is a peaceful community. We have our own irrigation system, so we can grow our own food. If we were not plagued with raiders and Radscorpions, we would have no problems.}
{7010}{}{[End.]}
{8000}{}{Are you sure you want me to give you directions to the Radscorpion caves?  I can't go, but I can show you the way.}
{8010}{}{Yes}
{8020}{}{No.}
{8030}{}{Uh-huh.}
{9000}{}{Ok, get ready.}
{9010}{}{[Transport]}
{10000}{}{Ok, just let me know when you are ready to go to the caves.}
{10010}{}{[End.]}
{11000}{}{Welcome to Shady Sands, stranger. Please holster that weapon while you are here.}
{11010}{}{[Done.]}
{12000}{}{Our entire town is grateful to you for destroying the radscorpions. Thank you.}
{12010}{}{I'd like some information.}
{12020}{}{See you later.}
{12030}{}{[Receive reward.]}
{13000}{}{Thanks to you, we are now safe from them.}
{13010}{}{You are welcome.}
{14000}{}{Hello again, how can I help you?}
{14010}{}{I don't need to know anything else.}
{100000001}{}{You gain 250 experience points for dealing with the radscorpion menace threatening Shady Sands. Return to Seth for your reward.}

